# Notifications

The engine publishes a validated signal. The notification subsystem decides
whether, where, and when to send. Telegram, WhatsApp Cloud API, and Discord
incoming webhooks are shipped channels. WhatsApp uses official Graph templates
and the 24-hour session window. No unofficial WhatsApp clients. Discord
delivery is an operator-pasted incoming webhook, not a bot send. Observation
threshold alerts are observations, never signals.
